function LifeChapters({profile,library=FILMS}:{profile:Demographics|null;library?:Film[]}){const chapters=lifeChapters(profile);const [open,setOpen]=useState<number|null>(null);if(!chapters.length)return <p className="ci-small">Share your age whenever you wish, and we can begin placing films within the chapters of your life.</p>;return <section className="ci-life-chapters"><div className="ci-eyebrow"><span/> A LIFE IN CINEMA</div><h2>The chapters of your life.</h2><p>These are approximate periods based on the age you shared. The films are reminders of their era, not a claim that you saw them then. Your memories may belong to quite different chapters.</p><div className="ci-chapter-list">{chapters.map((chapter,i)=>{const films=chapterFilms(chapter,library);return <article className="ci-chapter" key={chapter.lo}><button type="button" onClick={()=>setOpen(open===i?null:i)} aria-expanded={open===i}><span><small>{chapter.from} – {chapter.to} · approx.</small><strong>{chapter.name}</strong></span><span className="ci-chapter-count">{open===i?"Close":"Explore"}</span></button>{open===i&&<div className="ci-chapter-content">{films.length?<FilmMontage films={films}/>:<p>There are no stills from this period in the current library yet.</p>}<p className="ci-small">What do you remember watching during these years? It need not be one of these films.</p></div>}</article>})}</div><p className="ci-small">Broad life stages draw on <a href="https://openstax.org/books/psychology-2e/pages/9-3-stages-of-development" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">lifespan development psychology</a>. Adult decades are reflective subdivisions, not universal psychological stages. Ages and dates are approximate; development is individual.</p></section>}
